Ok, there are many many spin-offs of NH.  (NH is after all a spin-off of  
Rogue).  But they all cover the same old quest-for-AoY story.  But did  
anyone think about the sequel of Nethack?  Ok, the player got that  
demigodhoodness, the god his "deserved ascendance", but what happened then?

I have just thought about it and even some scetch of scenario sprouted in  
my mind.  It's cool, but a little more complicated than the original, and  
shows the original Nethack in less black-and-white tones.  However I am no  
coder.

So, did someone think about it/made something like this/wants to make this  
etc?  Please share any ideas.

